  "articleType": "opinion-knowledge",
  "tone": ["calm", "reflective", "instructional"],
  "structurePattern": "argument-evidence-conclusion",
  "theme": "tuo-content-method",
  "themeReason": "排版方法论文章需要清楚章节、结构化原则和克制的暖纸阅读感",
  "recipe": "opinion-analysis",
  "density": "balanced",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title-1",
      "type": "article-title",
      "role": "title",
      "content": "# 为什么极简主义排版更适合公众号",
      "phase": "entry",
      "gesture": "anchor",
      "emphasis": "strong"
    },
    {
      "id": "lead-1",
      "type": "lead",
      "role": "thesis",
      "content": "在信息过载的时代，好的排版不是加法，而是减法。",
      "phase": "entry",
      "gesture": "flow",
      "emphasis": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "role": "section",
      "content": "## 留白的力量",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "anchor",
      "emphasis": "medium",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "body-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "argument",
      "content": "当我们打开一篇公众号文章，映入眼帘的往往是密密麻麻的文字和花哨的装饰。但真正能让读者停下来阅读的，恰恰是那些懂得留白的文章。",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "flow",
      "emphasis": "quiet"
    },
    {
      "id": "body-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "explanation",
      "content": "留白不是空洞，而是呼吸。它给读者的眼睛一个休息的空间，让文字的力量得以显现。",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "pause",
      "emphasis": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "role": "section",
      "content": "## 三个核心原则",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "anchor",
      "emphasis": "medium",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "principles-1",
      "type": "list",
      "role": "principles",
      "content": "1. 层级清晰：标题、正文、引用各归其位\n2. 节奏感：段落之间有呼吸，不紧不松\n3. 克制：不为装饰而装饰",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "flow",
      "emphasis": "medium",
      "structure": {
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          { "ordinal": 1, "content": "层级清晰：标题、正文、引用各归其位" },
          { "ordinal": 2, "content": "节奏感：段落之间有呼吸，不紧不松" },
          { "ordinal": 3, "content": "克制：不为装饰而装饰" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quote-1",
      "type": "quote",
      "role": "evidence",
      "content": "> 好的设计是尽可能少的设计。 — Dieter Rams",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "pause",
      "emphasis": "medium",
      "structure": {
        "content": "好的设计是尽可能少的设计。",
        "hasAttribution": true,
        "attribution": "— Dieter Rams"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "role": "section",
      "content": "## 实践建议",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "anchor",
      "emphasis": "medium",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "body-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "recommendation",
      "content": "选择一个安静的主题，让内容说话。不需要每段都加粗，不需要每句都高亮。信任你的读者，他们会找到重点。",
      "phase": "body",
      "gesture": "flow",
      "emphasis": "quiet"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending-1",
      "type": "ending",
      "role": "conclusion",
      "content": "排版的最高境界，是让读者忘记排版的存在。",
      "phase": "exit",
      "gesture": "release",
      "emphasis": "medium"
    }
  ]
}
